{
    "background_story": "Killer was a majestic black stallion with a spirited personality to match his name. Despite his intimidating appearance, he had a gentle soul and a strong desire to please. His owner, a skilled trainer, had high hopes for Killer's career in show jumping. However, Killer had other intentions. He would often intentionally veer off course, as if to say, 'I have a different plan in mind.' His antics frustrated his owner, but also sparked curiosity. One day, it became clear that Killer intended to pursue a career in therapeutic riding instead. He had a natural talent for sensing and responding to the emotional needs of those around him. With a new focus, Killer's true potential was unleashed, and he went on to bring joy and comfort to countless people as a beloved therapy horse.",
